      "en": "When Peter had come up to Jerusalem, those who were of the circumcision contended with him,",
      "ko": "베드로가 예루살렘에 올라갔을 때에 할례자들이 힐난하여",
      "source_text_hash": "4abc325e986c2157f8a6e274f70ba9bdde31b97e17ce861cae866644b3ae5c2c",
      "translation_text_hash": "b7506ad22a084023a6237b15c28667243af6b638cd3372495d0ac1a4dbdbc336",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
