      "en": "When I had looked intently at it, I considered, and saw the four-footed animals of the earth, wild animals, creeping things, and birds of the sky.",
      "ko": "이것을 주목하여 보니 땅에 네 발 가진 것과 들짐승과 기는 것과 공중에 나는 것들이 보이더라",
      "source_text_hash": "c98110c0276a7a88eeb4cbb223fc3bb6f34ae1a70f062a0bc6e0bbd46ba66224",
      "translation_text_hash": "54973ec43f5339c7921896edd7d6998c5b7dee17013f5e28662bd1675a83e533",
