      "en": "He told us how he had seen the angel standing in his house and saying to him, ‘Send to Joppa and get Simon, who is called Peter,",
      "ko": "그가 우리에게 말하기를 천사가 내 집에 서서 말하되 네가 사람을 욥바에 보내어 베드로라 하는 시몬을 청하라",
      "source_text_hash": "b5b9875c12087910c3ef722ed3b3ad2080466c670398b74b8ca1915f463cf9a2",
      "translation_text_hash": "dcb7ccd84fabe09b8447d4ce961f944958fbe789e40cdd5aacb5e18ba846b7e4",
